{"seq":2,"slug":"handoff-identity-verification-queue-dispatch","title":"交付身份核验与取车排队调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bopis-curbside-pickup-store-fulfillment-orchestration/curbside-handoff-geofence/handoff-identity-verification-queue-dispatch","wordCount":2804,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"交付身份核验与取车排队调度\">交付身份核验与取车排队调度</h1><p>拣好的袋子已经封口、放上取车货架，但这笔订单还没有结束。真正的失败高发点在最后一百米：顾客的车停在店门口，店员要在一分钟内判断「这个人是不是这笔订单的主人」，然后决定「先服务谁」。前者是身份核验，后者是排队调度。两者共享一个稀缺资源——店员的注意力，因此必须放在同一套调度模型里设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一次路边交付在系统里被建模为四层对象，每层有自己的生命周期与失败语义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>交付会话（handoff session）</strong>：从订单进入「待取货」状态开始，到完成核验并确认交付为止的一次可中断状态机。</li>\n<li><strong>到达事件（arrival event）</strong>：地理围栏（geofence）触发或顾客手动点击「我到了」产生的一次时空事实，携带时间戳、去标识化的位置与可信度。</li>\n<li><strong>取货凭证（proof of pickup）</strong>：核验身份所依据的一组凭据，可以是订单码、一次性口令、车牌或设备 proximity。</li>\n<li><strong>派遣决策（dispatch decision）</strong>：把一位在岗店员分配给一个排队中的交付会话，输出「取车位 + 店员 + 预计动作时间」。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[订单进入待取货] --&gt; B[创建交付会话]&#10;  B --&gt; C{到达检测}&#10;  C --&gt;|geofence 触发| D[到达事件]&#10;  C --&gt;|顾客手动确认| D&#10;  C --&gt;|超时未到| X[会话过期/转自提柜台]&#10;  D --&gt; E[进入等待队列]&#10;  E --&gt; F[派遣决策: 取车位+店员]&#10;  F --&gt; G[出示取货凭证]&#10;  G --&gt; H{身份核验}&#10;  H --&gt;|通过| I[交付确认 + 关单]&#10;  H --&gt;|不通过| J[人工复核/升级]&#10;  I --&gt; K[释放店员回队列]&#10;  J --&gt; K\">graph TD\n  A[订单进入待取货] --&gt; B[创建交付会话]\n  B --&gt; C{到达检测}\n  C --&gt;|geofence 触发| D[到达事件]\n  C --&gt;|顾客手动确认| D\n  C --&gt;|超时未到| X[会话过期/转自提柜台]\n  D --&gt; E[进入等待队列]\n  E --&gt; F[派遣决策: 取车位+店员]\n  F --&gt; G[出示取货凭证]\n  G --&gt; H{身份核验}\n  H --&gt;|通过| I[交付确认 + 关单]\n  H --&gt;|不通过| J[人工复核/升级]\n  I --&gt; K[释放店员回队列]\n  J --&gt; K</pre><p>模型是否说得清，就看它能否同时回答三个问题：<strong>这个人凭什么被认作订单主人</strong>（凭证强度）、<strong>先服务谁</strong>（队列排序）、<strong>店员被占用了多久</strong>（服务时长与产能回补）。三者耦合：凭证越弱，核验耗时越长，服务时长上升，队列变长，又反过来逼系统降低核验标准——这是路边履约最典型的退化螺旋。</p>\n<h2 id=\"取货凭证的强度阶梯\">取货凭证的强度阶梯</h2><p>核验的本质是在「防冒领」与「少摩擦」之间选点。凭证可以按强度排成阶梯：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>凭证</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>抗重放</th>\n<th>摩擦</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>订单后四位 + 姓名</td>\n<td>顾客口述</td>\n<td>极弱（可枚举）</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>低价值、熟人店</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静态订单码</td>\n<td>邮件/App 内固定二维码</td>\n<td>弱（截图可复用）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>早期 BOPIS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态订单码（TOTP）</td>\n<td>每 30–60 秒轮换，基于共享密钥</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>主流 2026 方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一次性口令（OTP）</td>\n<td>短信/推送下发 6 位码</td>\n<td>中（短信可被转发）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>无 App 顾客</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>车牌识别（LPN）</td>\n<td>摄像头匹配订单绑定车牌</td>\n<td>中（套牌风险低但存在）</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>车道式取车</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备 proximity</td>\n<td>蓝牙/NFC 距店验证</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>有 App 的常客</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>TOTP 值得展开</strong>：其算法定义在 IETF 的 RFC 6238（Time-Based One-Time Password）中，构建于 RFC 4226（HOTP）之上，原理是把共享密钥与当前时间窗做 HMAC 后截断。把订单码做成 TOTP，就让「截图转发」在几十秒后自动失效，同时不增加顾客任何动作——这是它在 2026 年成为默认方案的原因。落地时密钥不能用订单号派生（订单号可猜），必须服务端随机生成并与订单绑定。</p>\n<p>二维码本身的编码标准是 ISO/IEC 18004；支付场景中由 EMVCo 维护的 EMV® QR Code Specification 定义了商户出示型（MPM）与顾客出示型（CPM）两类模式，零售交付码通常借用 CPM 的字段结构（一次性令牌 + 商户标识），可直接复用成熟的扫码枪与校验流程，避免自造协议。</p>\n<p><strong>阶梯不是越强越好</strong>：核验强度要与订单价值匹配。对高价值订单使用「动态码 + 店员目视核对取件人」的多因素组合，对低价值订单允许「动态码即可」，否则店员会被无谓的核对动作拖慢，服务时长上升直接恶化排队——凭证选择因此是一个调度参数，而非纯安全参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"地理围栏与到达检测\">地理围栏与到达检测</h2><p>geofence 是「顾客已到」的自动信号源。iOS 的 Core Location 提供 <code>CLCircularRegion</code> 式的区域监控，Android 侧对应 Geofencing API，但两者都受系统级节电策略限制：区域事件可能延迟数十秒甚至被漏报，圆形围栏在密集城区还会因 GPS 漂移频繁进出。</p>\n<p>因此工程上把到达检测做成<strong>多信源融合</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>arrived</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>geofence</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>manual</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>proximity</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>dwell</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{arrived}) = f(\\text{geofence}, \\text{manual}, \\text{proximity}, \\text{dwell})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">arrived</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">geofence</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">manual</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">proximity</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dwell</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>四个信号的权重与可信度不同，常见做法是「geofence 进入 + 停留超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 秒」才算到达，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 取 30–90 秒以滤掉路过车辆；顾客手动点击「我到了」作为兜底，但会引入<strong>抢跑</strong>（顾客在停车场外就点，店员提前出场空等）。</p>\n<p>围栏半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的取值是取舍：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 太小，车已到但系统没触发；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 太大，误报增加店员空跑。设取车位服务半径外的平均步行时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，店员提前出场的浪费期望为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>waste</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>false positive</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\text{waste}] = P(\\text{false positive}) \\cdot t_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">waste</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">false positive</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 从 100m 收到 50m，误报率下降但漏报率上升，最优 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 通常落在「车到取车位后仍有一次信号更新」的距离，现实经验值是 80–150m，并配合<strong>到达后 60 秒内二次确认</strong>来消除抖动。</p>\n<p>一个常被忽略的语义约束：<strong>geofence 事件是位置数据</strong>。位置属于个人数据（GDPR 第 4 条 (1)，以及 CJEU C-582/14「Breyer」判决确立的间接可识别标准），车牌同样被多数监管视为个人数据。因此到达事件应默认只存「已到达/未到达」这一类派生状态与时间戳，原始坐标仅在需要路径分析时才保留，并按隐私最小化原则设短保留期——送达确认本身不需要顾客的精确轨迹。</p>\n<h2 id=\"排队调度模型\">排队调度模型</h2><p>到达事件入队后，调度要决定「先服务谁」。排序规则直接决定两类指标：顾客等待时间的分布，与店员空转率。</p>\n<p>三条主流策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>先到先服务（FCFS）</strong>：按到达事件时间排序。公平、可解释，但会让「已承诺时段早」的顾客被后来者插队，且不感知服务时长差异。</li>\n<li><strong>承诺时段优先（promise-time priority）</strong>：按订单承诺取车时段排序。适合预约制，但会把无预约散客饿死。</li>\n<li><strong>最短服务优先（SJF）</strong>：先服务预计动作时间短的会话（如车道式、无需核验的常客）。平均等待时间最小，但长尾顾客（大单、需核对）会被反复推后。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>工程上通常做<strong>加权排序</strong>：以 FCFS 为基线，对承诺时段临近或超时者加权重：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>priority</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{priority}_i = \\frac{1}{w_1 \\cdot A_i + w_2 \\cdot U_i + \\varepsilon}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.912em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">priority</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1574em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是已到达时长，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是承诺时段紧迫度（已超时为负）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 防除零。这本质是把 EDD（Earliest Due Date）与 FCFS 混合，既保底公平又保承诺。</p>\n<p>等待队列的容量行为可以用排队论刻画。设到达率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>（到达事件/分钟，非泊松但常近似），店员数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，单人平均服务时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>，则系统负载为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = \\frac{\\lambda}{c \\mu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时等待时间非线性爆炸（Erlang-C 公式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），所以路边取车会把目标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 控制在 0.7–0.85，留出应对车流突发的缓冲。顾客侧的平均等待（含在车内的停留）满足 Little 定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span>，即排队车辆数 = 到达率 × 平均停留时长——这是判断「门口堵了几辆车」的直接工具，也是门店要不要加开取车位的决策依据。</p>\n<p>派遣还有<strong>取车位资源</strong>这一约束。若门店只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 个取车位，则并发服务的会话数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，即使店员充足也无法并行：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>并发服务上限</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{并发服务上限} = \\min(c, b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">并发服务上限</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>车道式取车（顾客排队经过固定窗口）把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 压到 1 但服务时长极短；停车位式（顾客停到预留位等店员）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 大但店员往返里程高。两者取舍取决于门店布局，与拣货波次释放的产能配平逻辑同源，可对照 <a href=\"../store-picking-packing/pick-task-wave-batching-model\">拣货任务生成与波次批次模型</a> 中的配平公式理解产能边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失败模式与护栏\">失败模式与护栏</h2><p>路边交付的缺陷集中在几处，逐一给出护栏：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失败模式</th>\n<th>触发</th>\n<th>护栏</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>凭证重放</td>\n<td>订单码截图被转发</td>\n<td>动态码（TOTP）+ 单次消费标记</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>订单码枚举</td>\n<td>短码可被穷举</td>\n<td>码空间 ≥ 128 bit，错误尝试限流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>geofence 抖动</td>\n<td>GPS 漂移导致反复进出</td>\n<td>停留阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> + 去抖窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抢跑</td>\n<td>顾客在店外点击「我到了」</td>\n<td>手动抵达需与 geofence 交叉验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发冒领</td>\n<td>同一订单两人同时出示</td>\n<td>核验通过即原子占用会话状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通知骚扰</td>\n<td>到达短信过高频次</td>\n<td>遵守 TCPA 明示同意，每会话限一条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话悬挂</td>\n<td>顾客不来，店员反复出场</td>\n<td>会话超时自动关闭并回归货架</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>并发冒领</strong>值得强调：两个顾客同时出示同一订单的动态码（一人截图转发给另一人），若核验与关单不是原子操作，就可能双份交付。正确做法是把交付会话当作<strong>聚合根</strong>，核验通过时以乐观锁或唯一约束抢占状态，第二个请求得到「该订单已交付」而非再次放行。这与库存侧的防超卖是同构问题，可参见 <a href=\"../store-promise-availability/reservation-oversell-sync-exception\">预留、超卖与同步异常</a> 中的幂等与唯一性设计。</p>\n<p><strong>通知合规</strong>是跨境经营中的真实雷区。美国《电话消费者保护法》（TCPA，47 U.S.C. § 227）对自动拨号/自动短信要求「事先明示书面同意」，到达通知这类事务性短信虽比营销宽松，但同意范围与退订机制仍需设计。发送渠道与内容应可审计，避免把位置信息写入短信正文。</p>\n<p>最后一个护栏是<strong>核验失败的可恢复性</strong>：核验不通过不等于拒单，而应进入人工复核通道，由店员在受控界面核对证件后放行，并记录降级原因。硬性拒单会把真顾客变成投诉，而 WISMO（Where Is My Order）类咨询的成本远高于一次人工核对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>路边交付的最后一百米是一个「安全强度 × 等待时间 × 店员产能」的三元约束：凭证强度决定核验耗时，到达检测的精度决定店员是否空跑，排队策略决定等待分布，而三者共享同一批店员与取车位资源。可落地的设计原则有四条——用 TOTP 动态码把核验强度拉到「截图即失效」而不增加顾客动作；用「geofence + 停留阈值 + 手动确认」的融合信号抑制误报与抢跑；用加权 EDD/FCFS 混合排序同时保住公平与承诺；把交付会话当作聚合根，用原子占用杜绝并发冒领。把位置与车牌按个人数据最小化处理，则是跨境经营中不可省略的合规底座。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"交付身份核验与取车排队调度","id":"交付身份核验与取车排队调度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"取货凭证的强度阶梯","id":"取货凭证的强度阶梯"},{"level":2,"text":"地理围栏与到达检测","id":"地理围栏与到达检测"},{"level":2,"text":"排队调度模型","id":"排队调度模型"},{"level":2,"text":"失败模式与护栏","id":"失败模式与护栏"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"到店地理围栏与签到模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bopis-curbside-pickup-store-fulfillment-orchestration/curbside-handoff-geofence/curbside-arrival-geofence-checkin-model"},"next":{"title":"取车等待 SLA 与失败恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bopis-curbside-pickup-store-fulfillment-orchestration/curbside-handoff-geofence/curbside-wait-sla-failure-recovery"}}